#: src/postulo/plugins/gdpr/__init__.py:43
#, draft
msgid "Data protection"
msgstr "Varstvo podatkov"

#: src/postulo/plugins/gdpr/__init__.py:45
#, draft
msgid ""
"The data the instance keeps about other people: what it holds on one contact, asked in one document, the erasure of one that says what it removed, a retention policy with a dry run that deletes nothing, the record of what the instance processes and who receives it, and the instance's own privacy notice. Switched off, the site offers none of these pages; nothing is deleted, because a switch is not a deletion."
msgstr ""
"Podatki, ki jih namestitev hrani o drugih ljudeh: kaj hrani o enem stiku, zahtevano v enem dokumentu, izbris enega, ki pove, kaj je odstranil, pravilnik o hrambi s poskusnim zagonom, ki ničesar ne izbriše, evidenca o tem, kaj namestitev obdeluje in kdo to prejema, ter lastno obvestilo o zasebnosti namestitve. Ko je izklopljeno, spletno mesto ne ponuja nobene od teh strani; nič se ne izbriše, ker stikalo ni izbris."
